WEBVTT

00:13:29.153 --> 00:13:31.110
da slediš svoje snove."

00:13:31.110 --> 00:13:35.232
Sa 64 godine, uradila sam nešto

00:13:35.232 --> 00:13:36.915
što niko nikad nije uspeo,

00:13:36.915 --> 00:13:38.679
i potpuno sam sigurna

00:13:38.679 --> 00:13:41.648
da sam danas u zenitu svog života.

00:13:41.648 --> 00:13:44.476
(Aplauz)

00:13:44.476 --> 00:13:45.944
Tako je.

00:13:50.058 --> 00:13:51.881
Hvala.

00:13:51.881 --> 00:13:54.035
I treće što sam rekla na toj plaži je:

00:13:54.035 --> 00:13:56.724
"Izgledalo je
kao najsamotniji napor na svetu

00:13:56.724 --> 00:13:58.716
i na mnogo načina, i jeste,

00:13:58.716 --> 00:14:01.269
a s druge, važnije strane